{"articleNo":"68036","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=68036&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"학생역량진단평가 신청 기간 연장","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.10.16","hit":"4234","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">대학교육역량강화사업단에서는 재학생을 대상으로 하는 K-CESA(Korea </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">Collegiate Essential Skills Assessment : 대학생 핵심역량 평가) 응시자 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">지원신청기간을 다음과 같이 연장</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">하오니 학생들의 많은 신청 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>가. 신청기간 연장</strong></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; WIDTH: 132.34pt; HEIGHT: 24.14pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">당초</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 132.34pt; HEIGHT: 24.14pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">변경</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; WIDTH: 132.34pt; HEIGHT: 24.14pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">10.8(월)-10.12(금)</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 132.34pt; HEIGHT: 24.14pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">10.8(월)-10.19(금)</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>나. 신청 방법 </strong>: 신청서 작성 후 각 학부(과) 행정실로 제출</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">다. 참여하는 학생에게는 <strong>다양한 인센티브를 제공</strong>할 예정이며, </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학생역량진단 평가 일정은 중간고사 기간을 고려하여 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 11월 초순(예정)경에 실시</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>* 배정인원을 초과한 학부(과)는 해당 없음</strong></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">라. 기타 신청서식 및 관련 내용은 게시글 2088</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(학생역량진단평가 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 참여자 신청 안내)참조</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
